error BYN2203: 300 does not fit in `u8`

  3 │ var n = 300;
    │         ^^^
    │
  help: `u8` holds 0 to 255

error BYN2203: -1 does not fit in `u64`

  8 │ var m = -1;
    │         ^^
    │
  help: `u64` holds 0 to 18446744073709551615

error BYN2760: `f64` cannot be a `Map` key

  31 │     Index<f64> idx;
     │     ^^^^^^^^^^ the generic code needs this of its type arguments
     │
  help: use an integer type, `char`, `bool`, `string` or a plain enum as the key
